  "ordinal": 0,
  "summary": "Finding Strength in Numbers\nEven though the industry may have been busy on this week's holiday party circuit, news suggests that business is still getting done between the networking and canapés. It was announced on Tuesday that Mitsui OSK Lines / Phoenix Tankers, AP Moller, SAMCO and Ocean Tankers have signed a letter of intent to form a new tanker pool. While the deal has yet to be finalized, this new pool is expected to begin operation in February 2012 and control a combined fleet of around 50 VLCC tankers by the end of next year.",
